{
  "name": "📲 Telegram Router — G54",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-router-info",
      "name": "📋 INFO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📲 Telegram Router — G54\n\nÚnico punto de entrada registrado en G54 (`agent_endpoints.telegram_agent`) para TODOS los mensajes de Telegram de cualquier empresa — G54 solo permite una URL por key, así que este router decide a cuál motor real reenviar cada mensaje según `empresa_id`.\n\n- `empresa_id == 1` (Crating Express) → motor de Marco (`CE Telegram Engine`, exclusivo de CE, sin tocar)\n- cualquier otra empresa → Sales AI Motor (canal Telegram genérico, multi-tenant)\n\nNo procesa nada por su cuenta — solo reenvía el body tal cual al webhook interno correspondiente.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "router-webhook",
      "name": "🔔 Webhook G54 (Telegram Router)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "telegram-router-g54",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "telegram-router-g54"
    },
    {
      "id": "router-decidir",
      "name": "🔀 Decidir Destino",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        140,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const body = $json.body || $json;\nconst empresaId = Number(body.empresa_id || 0);\nconst targetUrl = empresaId === 1\n  ? 'https://n8n.mdarthurdigital.com/webhook/telegram-marco-g54'\n  : 'https://n8n.mdarthurdigital.com/webhook/sales-telegram-g54';\nreturn [{ json: { targetUrl, body } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "router-reenviar",
      "name": "📤 Reenviar a Motor Correspondiente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        40
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.targetUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "🔔 Webhook G54 (Telegram Router)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "🔀 Decidir Destino",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "🔀 Decidir Destino": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "📤 Reenviar a Motor Correspondiente",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}